                The AI Boom and Infrastructure to Support It
            </h2>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                Thankfully, so much had changed since I last tried to do this. AI got me a long way in just these past two years of our AI bubble. This website was finally made exactly the way I wanted it to, using AI to work around many of the barriers that had stopped me years earlier.
            </p>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">
                I want to express a huge thank you to the platforms that enabled such a smooth deployment and infrastructure. Thanks to <strong>Vercel</strong> for the free frontend hosting, and <strong>Render</strong> for the backend hosting. Without these platforms, scaling and rolling out a scaled idea would have been a completely different experience.
            </p>
            <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08); padding: 1.25rem; border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid #38bdf8;">
                <em>"My favorite moment ever was seeing the real-time sync finally work. Watching as all of those actions synchronized onto both screens in a single snap made that midnight idea come to life."</em>
            </p>
